  "translation": "Rĩrĩria Yahwe Erohimu waku agĩthĩĩra ⟨את⟩ ciugo ciothe cia Rabicake, ũrĩa mũthamaki wa Ashuri, mwathi wake, atũmĩte agakũriria Erohimu Mũru, na agaciira ciugo iria Yahwe Erohimu waku athĩĩrire; nĩ ũndũ ũcio ũnyamure thabari ya arĩa maikarĩte iria ionekanĩte.",
